  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hamro Samman Programme - Countering trafficking in persons in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the incidence of human trafficking by strengthening action across the three pillars outlined in the Palermo Protocol: protection, prevention, prosecution. Work with all spheres of the Government of Nepal, civil society organisations and private sector; and will take a partnerships approach. Focus will on two sectors; foreign employment and the domestic entertainment industry.</narrative>
  </description>
